Upstream-Name: sshpilot
Upstream-Contact: mFat <newmfat@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/mfat/sshpilot
Comment: The bundled xterm.js assets under sshpilot/vendor/pyxtermjs/xterm/ are a
 convenience copy for non-Debian installs. The Debian binary package depends on
 libjs-xterm and excludes them (see debian/rules); the app resolves the system
 copy at /usr/share/javascript/xterm at runtime.

